                "text": ":zap: NEWS: I&amp;#39;m honored to be one of The GTM10 Awards winner in the Growth category, alongside leaders from OpenAI, Braze, Bolt, Pleo, &amp; co.\n\nThank you to Cello and Lightspeed for nominating me, as well as to the jury members for selecting me among the winners: Kyle Poyar, Heidrun Luyt, Prelini Udayan-Chiechi, and James da Costa :raised_hands:\n\nFor the occasion - and in addition to a nice trophy - I was honored to have my face featured on Timesquare&amp;#39;s NASDAQ Billboard... no words!\n\nOf course this is a great recognition, but the credit goes above all to my team and the members of Bulldozer. This award would be impossible without their commitment and their great results for our clients, so for that, thank you. I&amp;#39;m very proud to collaborate with you all :pray:\n\nNow, let&amp;#39;s go back to work and…\n\nLet&amp;#39;s grow :facepunch:\n\nPS : If you&amp;#39;d like to know more about the winners, it&amp;#39;s right here :point_right: <https:\/\/lnkd.in\/d5u38Mkk> | 25 comments on LinkedIn",
